# {project_title} — Conventions

This repository was onboarded onto alan with the **node** stack preset. `npm ci`
installs exact dependency versions from the lockfile; `npm run <script>` runs
project tooling.

## Commands

```bash
npm ci
npm run test
npm run lint
```

## Gates (CI, `.github/workflows/ci.yml`)

The `node-ci` check runs on every pull request and must pass before merge:

- `npm run test`
- `npm run lint`

## Dependencies

Dependabot (`.github/dependabot.yml`) opens weekly update pull requests for both
project dependencies and GitHub Actions.
